#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:1
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer0Intro"
msgid ""
"Have you made a SECRET BASE already?\p"
"I went here, there, everywhere before\n"
"choosing this place.\p"
"Since you're already here, how would\n"
"you like to battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:8
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer0AcceptBattle"
msgid ""
"Okay!\n"
"Here we come!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:12
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer0DeclineBattle"
msgid ""
"Hunh?\n"
"Oh, you can't now…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:16
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer0Defeated"
msgid ""
"Waaargh! You're too strong!\n"
"About me losing… Please keep it secret!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:20
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer0PostBattle"
msgid ""
"What do you think of my SECRET BASE?\n"
"Come visit me again tomorrow.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:24
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer0PreChampion"
msgid ""
"Have you made a SECRET BASE already?\p"
"I went here, there, everywhere before\n"
"choosing this place.\p"
"Feel free to hang out!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:30
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer5Intro"
msgid ""
"There're a lot of places where\n"
"you can make a SECRET BASE.\p"
"But I like this spot best.\n"
"Don't you think it's nice?\p"
"Oh, would you like to have a battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:37
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer5AcceptBattle"
msgid "Okay, here goes!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:40
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer5DeclineBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh…\n"
"You can't now, okay.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:44
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer5Defeated"
msgid ""
"Hmmm… It's our loss…\n"
"But don't tell anyone!\l"
"It's a confidential secret!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:49
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer5PostBattle"
msgid ""
"If you're in this area again,\n"
"I hope you'll visit me.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:53
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer5PreChampion"
msgid ""
"There're a lot of places where you can\n"
"make a SECRET BASE.\p"
"But I like this spot best.\n"
"Don't you think it's nice?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:59
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer1Intro"
msgid ""
"This is a popular spot.\n"
"It's always taken.\p"
"Oh! Were you thinking about\n"
"taking this spot, too?\p"
"I'll tell you what, you can have this\n"
"spot if you can beat me.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:67
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer1AcceptBattle"
msgid ""
"Okay!\n"
"I'm going to defend my SECRET BASE!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:71
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer1DeclineBattle"
msgid ""
"Hunh? Is that right?\n"
"You're not interested in this spot?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:75
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer1Defeated"
msgid ""
"I can't keep going!\n"
"I surrender!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:79
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer1PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Okay, when I move one day,\n"
"this place will be yours!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:83
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer1PreChampion"
msgid ""
"This is a popular spot.\n"
"It's always taken.\p"
"I waited a long time for it to open.\n"
"I finally got to use it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:89
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer6Intro"
msgid ""
"Welcome to my POKéMON LAB.\p"
"I carry out research on battling in\n"
"secrecy.\p"
"Would you like to see how strong I am?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:95
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer6AcceptBattle"
msgid "I'm going to go all out!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:98
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer6DeclineBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh.\n"
"Some other time, then!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:102
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer6Defeated"
msgid ""
"Hmm… I've still got lots to learn.\n"
"I have to study some more.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:106
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer6PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Thanks for battling with me.\n"
"Please come back again tomorrow.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:110
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer6PreChampion"
msgid ""
"Welcome to my POKéMON LAB.\p"
"I carry out research on battling in\n"
"secrecy.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:115
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer2Intro"
msgid ""
"A big mansion is nice, but I like this\n"
"sort of place more.\p"
"I like it because all kinds of people\n"
"come visit me.\p"
"So, how would you like a battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:122
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer2AcceptBattle"
msgid "That's the way!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:125
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer2DeclineBattle"
msgid "When you're ready, give me a shout!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:128
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer2Defeated"
msgid ""
"Aww! Done in!\n"
"But it's still fun to battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:132
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer2PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Well, anyway, I should go buy some\n"
"decorations and furniture.\p"
"I want my SECRET BASE to be a place\n"
"other people can enjoy.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:138
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer2PreChampion"
msgid ""
"A big mansion is nice, but I like this\n"
"sort of place more.\p"
"I like it because all kinds of people\n"
"come visit me.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:144
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer7Intro"
msgid ""
"I simply adore shopping for decorations\n"
"and furniture.\p"
"I also love raising POKéMON just\n"
"as much.\p"
"If you would be so kind, will you battle\n"
"with my POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:152
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer7AcceptBattle"
msgid ""
"Thank you.\n"
"Shall we begin?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:156
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer7DeclineBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh.\n"
"How disappointing…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:160
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer7Defeated"
msgid "I concede…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:163
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer7PostBattle"
msgid ""
"That was all in good fun!\n"
"I should go enjoy shopping now.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:167
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer7PreChampion"
msgid ""
"I simply adore shopping for decorations\n"
"and furniture.\p"
"I also love raising POKéMON just\n"
"as much.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:173
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer3Intro"
msgid ""
"Some people make their SECRET BASES in\n"
"hard-to-find places.\l"
"Do they want to just lie low?\p"
"But since you found me, how about we\n"
"have a battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:180
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer3AcceptBattle"
msgid "I'm not going down easily!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:183
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer3DeclineBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh… Are you maybe tired from searching\n"
"for this place?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:187
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer3Defeated"
msgid "I went down…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:190
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer3PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Where's your SECRET BASE?\n"
"I should go visit you there.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:194
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer3PreChampion"
msgid ""
"Some people make their SECRET BASES in\n"
"hard-to-find places.\l"
"Do they want to just lie low?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:199
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer8Intro"
msgid ""
"People have told me that you can get\n"
"decorations in several ways.\p"
"We should have a race to see who can\n"
"get nicer decorations and furniture!\p"
"In the meantime, want to battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:206
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer8AcceptBattle"
msgid ""
"This is my SECRET BASE.\n"
"I can't lose!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:210
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer8DeclineBattle"
msgid "I'll battle with you anytime.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:213
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer8Defeated"
msgid ""
"Huh?\n"
"Did I just lose?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:217
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer8PostBattle"
msgid ""
"I won't lose at collecting decorations.\n"
"Come visit again!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:221
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer8PreChampion"
msgid ""
"People have told me that you can get\n"
"decorations in several ways.\p"
"We should have a race to see who can\n"
"get nicer decorations and furniture!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:227
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer4Intro"
msgid ""
"I found a spot I liked, and I did it up\n"
"with my favorite decorations.\p"
"I raise my favorite POKéMON and grow\n"
"stronger with it.\p"
"That's what I do.\n"
"Want to battle with me?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:235
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer4AcceptBattle"
msgid "Show me what you're made of!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:238
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer4DeclineBattle"
msgid ""
"I guess there are times when you're not\n"
"into it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:242
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer4Defeated"
msgid "I know exactly what you're made of now.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:245
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer4PostBattle"
msgid ""
"We can both become stronger.\n"
"Let's keep at it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:249
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer4PreChampion"
msgid ""
"I found a spot I liked, and I did it up\n"
"with my favorite decorations.\p"
"I raise my favorite POKéMON and grow\n"
"stronger with it.\p"
"Every day is a great day.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:256
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer9Intro"
msgid ""
"You can learn a lot about the taste\n"
"and sense of people by the kinds of\l"
"decorations they have, and how they\l"
"display them.\p"
"What do you think of my taste?\n"
"Are you speechless?\p"
"Want to see my taste in battling?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:265
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer9AcceptBattle"
msgid "There's no holding back!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:268
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer9DeclineBattle"
msgid ""
"I'll be happy to demonstrate my style\n"
"anytime.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:272
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer9Defeated"
msgid ""
"You're supremely talented!\n"
"Your power seems to be limitless…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:276
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer9PostBattle"
msgid ""
"What did you think of my style?\n"
"I'll keep on polishing it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc:280
msgctxt "SecretBase_Text_Trainer9PreChampion"
msgid ""
"You can learn a lot about the taste\n"
"and sense of people by the kinds of\l"
"decorations they have, and how they\l"
"display them.\p"
"What do you think of my taste?\n"
"Are you speechless?$"
msgstr ""
